\title{Pretraining}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{notes}

\p{Pretraining fits the parameters of a language model to a large corpus by
predicting tokens from preceding tokens. This description leaves the data law,
window sampler, loss mask, population objective, finite-sample objective, and
update rule unspecified. Each receives a separate definition below.}

